    "text": "Skip to main content Campus Info Campus Info SMU is the Premier Choice Conference Services is proud to call Southern Methodist University home. Conveniently located in the center of the exciting city of Dallas, SMU is a private university of over 11,000 students. A nationally ranked private university with seven degree-granting schools, SMU is a distinguished center for teaching and research. The best way to experience our beautiful campus is by visiting in-person. But if time and distance is an issue, we have several options to bring the Hilltop to you! Learn more about SMU Learn More About SMU Explore our Interactive Campus Map Take a Virtual Tour of our campus. SMU's main campus continues to rank as one of the most beautiful college campuses in the country. Search the SMU website Menu Close Search Search Submit Popular Searches Current Students Majors and Minors Undergraduate Admission | SMU Graduate Admission Faculty & Staff Graduate Programs Alumni Did you know? SMU's singular approach to integrating rigorous learning with hands-on experience will prepare you to achieve your educational goals and expand your world in ways you never imagined. Ours is a community of people forging their own paths. We'd like to help you shape yours. Plan your visit",
